# Praman Financial Copilot - Environment Configuration
# ZERO API KEYS REQUIRED: Praman runs 100% out-of-the-box in deterministic offline/online mode:
# 1. Local Deterministic Intake & PII Redactor (Zero external data leaks)
# 2. In-Memory DuckDB Analytical Plane (10,040 rows indexed across 5 tables)
# 3. 4 Live Keyless Public APIs with fast 2.0s timeouts and venue Wi-Fi fallback caches:
#    - Razorpay IFSC API (https://ifsc.razorpay.com/{ifsc})
#    - India Post Pincode API (https://api.postalpincode.in/pincode/{pincode})
#    - Frankfurter FX API (https://api.frankfurter.app/latest?from=USD&to=INR)
#    - XposedOrNot Breach Check API (https://api.xposedornot.com/v1/check-email/{email})
# 4. Deterministic Exact Rupee Runway Calculator (cashflow_math.py)

# API Server Configuration
PORT=8000
HOST=127.0.0.1
ENVIRONMENT=development
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Database Plane (DuckDB)
DUCKDB_PATH=praman-data/praman.duckdb
RAW_CSVS_DIR=praman-data/raw_csvs

# OPTIONAL: OpenAI-Compatible Multi-Provider LLM Integration
# Division of Labor: "AI Reads & Explains · Deterministic Code Decides"
# - Job A (ai_extract_intake): Reads noisy bank SMS / narration into structured JSON (PII redacted)
# - Job B (ai_synthesize_memo): Converts deterministic DuckDB findings into plain-language executive memo
# 100% of SQL generation, execution, and math remains deterministic in DuckDB & Python.
#
# Supported Providers:
# 1. Groq (Ultra-fast, Llama-3.3 / GPT-OSS):
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
# LLM_PROVIDER=groq
# LLM_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b
#
# 2. OpenRouter (Free / Multi-model):
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-...
# LLM_PROVIDER=openrouter
# LLM_MODEL=openrouter/free
#
# 3. OpenAI:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# LLM_PROVIDER=openai
# LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# 4. Google Gemini:
# GEMINI_API_KEY=AIzaSy...
# LLM_PROVIDER=gemini
# LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash
#
# If no API key is set, Praman runs completely offline using local deterministic parsers.

# Frontend CORS Allowed Origins
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173,http://127.0.0.1:5173,http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000
